<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Hentschel, Glimm, Glazier & Newman (2004) Proc. R. Soc. B / Kiskowski et al. (2004) Dev. Biol. multiscale TGF-beta / FGF-inhibitor reaction-diffusion and fibronectin haptotaxis PDE in developing Gallus gallus limb bud — Code-to-model traceability: 58/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Basic docstrings are present, but functions lack explicit equation mappings to Hentschel et al. (2004) Eqs. (2.1)-(3.14), Kiskowski et al. (2004) haptotaxis kinetics, and the 3 Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_014_tgfb_fibronectin_limb.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2004-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb.py L25–L38: Docstrings omit explicit equation numbers and Lean 4 theorem cross-references <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2004-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb.py#L25-L38>" ;
    pk:hasScore 5.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Hentschel, Glimm, Glazier & Newman (2004) Proc. R. Soc. B / Kiskowski et al. (2004) Dev. Biol. multiscale TGF-beta / FGF-inhibitor reaction-diffusion and fibronectin haptotaxis PDE in developing Gallus gallus limb bud — Model fidelity to source: 49/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Evaluates the analytical TGF-beta / inhibitor wavenumber `compute_hentschel_dispersion`, but replaces the coupled 4-field `(c_a, c_i, F, R)` reaction-diffusion-haptotaxis PDE and 2D proximodistal wing bud solver with a static trigonometric profile without integrating `dF/dt = k_F*c_a^+*R_2 - gamma_F*F` or `dR/dt = D_R*Lap(R) - chi_F*div(R*grad(F)) + r_R*R*(1-R)`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2004-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb.py L25–L35: Analytical wavenumber formula without 4-field haptotactic PDE integration <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2004-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb.py#L25-L35>" ;
    pk:hasScore 4.9e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Hentschel, Glimm, Glazier & Newman (2004) Proc. R. Soc. B / Kiskowski et al. (2004) Dev. Biol. multiscale TGF-beta / FGF-inhibitor reaction-diffusion and fibronectin haptotaxis PDE in developing Gallus gallus limb bud — Morphometric validation: 42/100" ;
