<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Hentschel, Glimm, Glazier & Newman (2004) Proc. R. Soc. B / Kiskowski et al. (2004) Dev. Biol. multiscale TGF-beta / FGF-inhibitor reaction-diffusion and fibronectin haptotaxis PDE in developing Gallus gallus limb bud — MorphoEval overall 46.4/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `2004-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb.py` (overall weighted score: 48.2 / 100). The v1 baseline script evaluates the analytical TGF-beta / inhibitor wavenumber formula `m = sqrt(fa - 2)` for stylopod (`m=1`) and wing autopod (`m=3`), but approximates fibronectin and mesenchymal cell density via static algebraic scaling of a cosine wave rather than numerically integrating the coupled 4-field `(c_a, c_i, F, R)` reaction-diffusion-haptotaxis PDE (`dR/dt = D_R*Lap(R) - chi_F*div(R*grad(F)) + r_R*R*(1-R)`); omits the 2D composite proximodistal wing bud solver, the 2D micromass nodular-spot vs TGF-beta2-stripe morphospace (Miura & Shiota 2000; Kiskowski et al. 2004), and anti-fibronectin (`chi_F=0`) / equal-diffusion (`Da=Di`) negative controls; does not load or segment the vendored Gallus gallus limb specimen; and returns only 2 analytical scalar endpoints in `measure_morphoeval()`. Overall 46.4/100 (faithfulness 39.4, reproducibility 62.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 49, Morphological realism / specimen match 28, Parameter expressivity 45, Morphometric validation 42, Source and data traceability 60, Code-to-model traceability 58, Reproducibility package 68. Output judged: docs/media/tgfb_fibronectin_limb_comparison.png: rendered output of 2004-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb.py at 8871db0, image/png, 719240 B, 2230×1349 px, artifact_sha256 eea82e7f7885e55ae30c9fe24dc1c7543fe1efe2cba337aec39970ed1c704b86 (sha256 eea82e7f7885e55ae30c9fe24dc1c7543fe1efe2cba337aec39970ed1c704b86), spec_fingerprint a2738dce4265d3cbf1985dad5976f0edb36bd4a8ed6349bde78d12e6cc7cd510. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: a2738dce4265d3cbf1985dad5976f0edb36bd4a8ed6349bde78d12e6cc7cd510; artifact_sha256: eea82e7f7885e55ae30c9fe24dc1c7543fe1efe2cba337aec39970ed1c704b86; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/tgfb_fibronectin_limb/chick_limb_chondrogenesis_specimen.jpg=771e26f9fe8c813d..., datasets/tgfb_fibronectin_limb/scout_manifest.json=c810bd77e66557c8..., datasets/tgfb_fibronectin_limb/tgfb_fibronectin_limb_reference.json=33d554e44b712e2b...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Expose full CLI parameters (--fa, --L-AP-um, --Da, --Di, --chi-F, --k-F, --steps, --seed), expand `measure_morphoeval()` to 8 reference-backed morphometric measurements, and render the 8-panel comparison PNG and 4-frame growth GIF.",
        "remediation needed: Load and SHA-256-verify all 4 files in `datasets/tgfb_fibronectin_limb/` at runtime; segment the humerus (1 bone), radius+ulna (2 bones), and digits II-IV (3 elements) from `chick_limb_chondrogenesis_specimen.jpg`; and compare specimen bone counts and spacing ratios against the 4-field PDE.",
        "remediation needed: Replace the static cosine profile with a genuine 4-field coupled reaction-diffusion-haptotaxis PDE solver integrating TGF-beta (c_a), FGF-dependent inhibitor (c_i), ECM fibronectin (F), and haptotactic mesenchymal cell density (R) via DCT-II IMEX + conservative haptotactic flux discretization in 1D and 2D.",
        "remediation needed: Simulate all 4 proximodistal AER-FGF zonation regimes from Hentschel et al. (2004) (HH20 stylopod fa=3 -> 1 humerus; HH24 zeugopod fa=6 -> 2 radius+ulna; HH27 wing autopod fa=11 -> 3 digits II-IV; HH28 leg/high-TGFb fa=18 -> 4 pedal digits), the 2D micromass nodular-spot vs exogenous TGF-beta2 stripe morphospace (Kiskowski et al. 2004; Miura & Shiota 2000), and dual negative controls (equal diffusion Da=Di=0.5 and anti-fibronectin no-haptotaxis chi_F=0)." ;
    pk:hasScore 4.64e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hentschel-tgfb-fibronectin-limb-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Hentschel, Glimm, Glazier & Newman (2004) Proc. R. Soc. B / Kiskowski et al. (2004) Dev. Biol. multiscale TGF-beta / FGF-inhibitor reaction-diffusion and fibronectin haptotaxis PDE in developing Gallus gallus limb bud — Parameter expressivity: 45/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Evaluates only 3 static mode numbers without simulating the full 4-stage AER-FGF zonation series (`m = 1 -> 2 -> 3 -> 4`), omits the 2D micromass nodular-spot vs exogenous TGF-beta2 stripe morphospace (Miura & Shiota 2000; Kiskowski et al. 2004), omits anti-fibronectin (`chi_F = 0`) and equal-diffusion (`Da = Di`) negative controls, and exposes only `--self-test` on the CLI." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-parameter-expressivity> ;
